## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### EXP Sustain Control (EXP)

- Items: Tough Boots, War Axe, Queen's Wings, Oracle, Dominance Ice, Immortality
- Core: War Axe, Queen's Wings, Oracle
- Emblem: Fighter Emblem with Firmness, Festival of Blood, Brave Smite
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Warrior Boots over Tough Boots when Use into physical EXP lanes when crowd control is light and early armor decides whether Ruby can hold the wave.; Athena's Shield over Dominance Ice when Use against one-shot magic burst that can remove Ruby before Queen's Wings or Brave Smite can stabilize the fight.; Antique Cuirass over Dominance Ice when Use when the main threat is repeated physical skill damage rather than healing, shields, or attack speed.; Brute Force Breastplate over Dominance Ice when Use when Ruby needs movement speed and control-duration reduction to keep spacing through long objective fights.
- Total cost: 11040 gold

Default EXP setup for games where Ruby farms War Axe into Queen's Wings, then uses Flicker angles to turn sustain into reliable crowd control.

### EXP Vengeance Brawler (EXP)

- Items: Warrior Boots, War Axe, Queen's Wings, Brute Force Breastplate, Antique Cuirass, Immortality
- Core: War Axe, Queen's Wings, Brute Force Breastplate
- Emblem: Fighter Emblem with Firmness, Festival of Blood, Brave Smite
- Battle spell: Vengeance
- Flex: Tough Boots over Warrior Boots when Use when crowd control or magic poke matters more than the first physical lane trades.; Dominance Ice over Antique Cuirass when Use when the enemy EXP, roamer, or marksman depends on healing, shields, or attack speed to win extended fights.; Oracle over Antique Cuirass when Use when anti-sustain is already covered and extra received healing plus cooldown reduction will decide Ruby's second skill cycle.; Blade Armor over Antique Cuirass when Use when a basic-attack marksman has to hit Ruby during Vengeance before your back line can answer.
- Total cost: 11230 gold

Durable EXP setup for physical-heavy drafts where Ruby is expected to absorb the first hit instead of spending Flicker for the opening catch.

### Roam Catch Frontline (Roam)

